{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14966","headline":"同王员外雨後登开元寺南楼因寄西岩警上人 · 卢纶","name":"同王员外雨後登开元寺南楼因寄西岩警上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"过雨开楼看晚虹，白云相逐水相通。\n寒蝉噪暮野无日，古树伤秋天有风。\n数穗远烟凝壠上，一枝繁果忆山中。\n何言暂别东林友，惆怅人间事不同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14966.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14966","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}